      },
      "message": "fix(post): split near-180 R arcs and verify chord <= 2|R| after rounding\n\nIn emitArcWithRadius across fanuc, haas, mazak, doosan-dnm, tormach, and\ngrblhal, average both endpoint radii (falling back to I/J/K when they\ndiverge), split near-180 and near-360 degree arcs into quadrant-sized\nsegments, and verify every segment against rounded R and chord bounds\nbefore emitting any block.\n\nFixes #2191\n\nCo-Authored-By: Antigravity (len) <noreply@google.com>",
